      "role": "user",
      "content": "the nautical stuff is a bit much for a corporate memo lol. can we dial back the metaphors and just make it a bit more descriptive about those small, annoying aches? like how they start off small and just kind of nag at you or mess with your focus throughout the afternoon. just a more relatable way to describe the physical strain without the sailing theme.",
